Changes made by Hybrowlabs (OPS-636), as required by section 4(b) of the licence:

  - Lead discovery reads Lead Ocean and/or an operator dataset instead of BetterContact
    Lead Finder: new configuration answers and migration
    (openoutreach/config/models.py, openoutreach/config/migrations/0004_discovery_sources.py),
    a lead-source question in place of the BetterContact one (openoutreach/wizard.py), and
    the dependency now points at the Hybrowlabs OpenOutFind (pyproject.toml).
  - Sending is off unless OPENOUTREACH_ALLOW_SEND is set; `run` finds leads only unless
    given --send as well; onboarding asks for no mailbox and opens no mailbox connection
    while sending is off (openoutreach/__main__.py, openoutreach/wizard.py).
  - Publishing jobs do not run outside the upstream repository (.github/workflows/deploy.yml).
  - Tests: tests/test_wizard.py, tests/test_cli.py, tests/test_run.py.
  - Documentation: README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/pilot.md, NOTICE.

Upstream behaviour remains available by setting OPENOUTFIND_DISCOVERY_PROVIDER=bettercontact
(the finder side) and OPENOUTREACH_ALLOW_SEND=1 (the sending side).
